{
  "settings": null,
  "items": [
    {
      "q": "HOW DO WE BOOK YOU?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Kindly fill out the form in the bookings tab, or <a class=\"click-here-link\" href=\"https://tplumphotography.com/contact\">click here</a>. We will contact you shortly.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "HOW SOON SHOULD WE BOOK?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>We recommend booking early, as our calendar tends to fill up quickly.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU GIVE POSING DIRECTION?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Yes, we intentionally guide our couples with posing to create beautiful, timeless images. Alongside guided posing, we focus on documenting natural, candid moments that reflect the true emotions, joy and rich story of your day.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU RETOUCH YOUR IMAGES?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Absolutely. However, not excessive to the point where you don't look natural. We focus on showcasing our unique tone and styles, embracing some imperfections to reflect genuine and relatable experiences. If there are specific editing requests, we are happy to discuss. This includes light skin smoothing, blemish removal, etc.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "HOW MANY HOURS OF COVERAGE ARE INCLUDED?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Our standard wedding/event coverage includes up to 12 hours, ensuring we capture every key moment from start to finish.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "WHAT’S INCLUDED IN YOUR PHOTOGRAPHY PACKAGES?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Each package includes a set number of hours, professionally edited images, and an online gallery. Additional services like photobook and extra coverage are available.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU PROVIDE VIDEOGRAPHY?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Yes, we do.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "WHEN WILL I RECEIVE MY IMAGES?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Engagement Sessions take 5-7 days after selection. <br>Weddings take 4 weeks<br>However, we understand the excitement of reliving your special day! That's why we send a few sneak peek images during the first week after your wedding.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "HOW MANY IMAGES WILL I RECEIVE?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>This varies based on the scope of the wedding, such as number of hours booked. Number of images can range from 400-1500 photos.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU OFFER ENGAGEMENT SHOOTS? IS IT INCLUDED?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Yes, we do offer engagement shoots. It's a great way for us to get to know each other before the big day, and it helps you both get comfortable in front of the camera. We will also guide you on locations, mood boards, and the best time to shoot.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU HAVE A TEAM?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Yes, we do! We work with a trusted team of second shooters and videographers and assistants to ensure everything runs smoothly, especially for larger weddings. Everyone we work with is professionally trained and shares our approach and style, so you’ll get a seamless experience throughout the day.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU OFFER ALBUMS OR WEDDING PHOTO-FRAMES?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Yes, we do offer both photo books and framed prints! We have a range of high-quality photo books that are perfect for preserving your images in a beautiful, tangible format. We also offer a selection of frames and wall art options in various sizes and finishes.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU ONLY SHOOT WEDDINGS?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>We also provide maternity, studio portraits, proposals, engagement, and corporate event photography.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO YOU TRAVEL?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Yes we do! Please reach out to us to discuss travel details with you.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "HOW MANY PEOPLE ON YOUR TEAM WILL BE AT MY WEDDING?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>One or two photographes and a light assistant depending on the package you opt for.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    },
    {
      "q": "DO WE OWN THE RIGHTS TO THE IMAGES?",
      "aHtml": "<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><p>Once your photos are delivered, you receive personal usage rights, which means you’re free to share, print, and enjoy them for personal purposes. However, the copyright remains with the photographer. This allows us to use the images for our portfolio, website, and promotional materials, but rest assured, we’ll always respect your privacy and never share sensitive moments without your consent. If you have any concerns about this, we can always discuss it during consultations.</p></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>"
    }
  ],
